#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:4
msgid "Сигналы"
msgstr "Signals"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:6
msgid "Содержание"
msgstr "Contents"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:8
msgid ""
":ref:`События Citeck <bpmn_events_integrations>` реализуются через "
"сигналы. Сигнал может быть доставлен нескольким активным обработчикам, "
"подписки которых соответствуют имени сигнала и настроенным фильтрам по "
"документу, типу документа и предикатам."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Citeck events <bpmn_events_integrations>` are implemented through "
"signals. A signal may be delivered to multiple active handlers whose "
"subscriptions match the signal name and configured document, document "
"type, and predicate filters."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:10
msgid "Сигналы типов Throw и Catch выполняются по имени сигнала."
msgstr "Throw and Catch signals are executed by signal name."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:13
msgid "Определение событий (сигналов)"
msgstr "Event (Signal) Definitions"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:16
msgid "Форма"
msgstr "Form"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:23
msgid "Атрибуты"
msgstr "Attributes"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:26
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:482
msgid "Ручная настройка"
msgstr "Manual Configuration"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:28
msgid ""
"Флаг, который позволяет переключить настройку сигнала в ручной режим — "
"указание имени сигнала, а не выбор из предустановленных типов событий."
msgstr ""
"A flag that allows switching signal configuration to manual mode — "
"specifying the signal name instead of selecting from predefined event "
"types."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:31
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:484
msgid "Имя сигнала"
msgstr "Signal Name"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:33
msgid "Служит для идентификации сигнала."
msgstr "Used to identify the signal."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:35
msgid ""
"Данное поле становится доступно если включена опция ``Ручная настройка``."
" Если выбран ``тип события``, то имя генерируется автоматически."
msgstr ""
"This field becomes available if the ``Manual Configuration`` option is "
"enabled. If an ``event type`` is selected, the name is generated "
"automatically."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:38
msgid "Модель данных"
msgstr "Data Model"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:40
msgid ""
"Каждое событие имеет свою полезную нагрузку (payload). Например, событие "
"``Статус изменен`` содержит информацию о новом и предыдущем статусе."
msgstr ""
"Each event has its own payload. For example, the ``Status Changed`` event"
" contains information about the new and previous status."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:42
msgid ""
"Модель данных представляет собой ``map``, где ``ключ`` — имя атрибута, по"
" которому будет доступно вычисленное значение, а ``значение`` — "
":ref:`Records API атрибут <Records API attribute>`."
msgstr ""
"The data model is a ``map`` where the ``key`` is the attribute name by "
"which the computed value will be accessible, and the ``value`` is a "
":ref:`Records API attribute <Records API attribute>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:44
msgid ""
"Таким образом, модель данных позволяет указать, какие данные будут "
"передаваться в сигнале. Пользовательская модель переопределяет "
"совпадающие обычные поля :ref:`payload по умолчанию "
"<ecos_bpmn_signal_event_defaut_payload>`. Служебные поля ``_meta``, "
"``record`` и ``recordType`` формируются из исходного события и не "
"переопределяются пользовательской моделью."
msgstr "The data model therefore specifies which data is passed in the signal. A custom model overrides matching regular fields in the :ref:`default payload <ecos_bpmn_signal_event_defaut_payload>`. The service fields ``_meta``, ``record``, and ``recordType`` are generated from the source event and are not overridden by a custom model."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:47
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:508
msgid "Фильтр события по документу"
msgstr "Event Filter by Document"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:49
msgid ""
"Позволяет отфильтровать события на основе документа, по которому "
"возникает данное событие. Поле имеет 3 значения:"
msgstr ""
"Allows filtering events based on the document for which this event "
"occurs. The field has 3 values:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:51
msgid "``Любой документ`` — событие будет происходить для любого документа."
msgstr "``Any document`` — the event will occur for any document."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:52
msgid ""
"``Текущий документ`` — событие будет происходить только для документа по "
"которому идет бизнес процесс."
msgstr ""
"``Current document`` — the event will occur only for the document "
"associated with the business process."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:53
msgid ""
"``Документ из переменной процесса`` — событие будет возникать только для "
"документа, который указан в поле ``Имя переменной``."
msgstr ""
"``Document from process variable`` — the event will occur only for the "
"document specified in the ``Variable Name`` field."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:55
msgid ""
"Для варианта **«Текущий документ»** используется business key экземпляра "
"процесса. Он должен соответствовать полной ссылке на документ. Если "
"business key переопределён, фильтрация может отличаться от значения "
"``documentRef``."
msgstr "**Current document** uses the process instance business key. It must match the document's full reference. If the business key is overridden, filtering may differ from ``documentRef``."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:58
msgid "Фильтр события по типу документа"
msgstr "Event filter by document type"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:60
msgid ""
"Доступен только при выборе **«Любой документ»** и ограничивает события "
"заданным типом документа. С вариантами **«Текущий документ»** и "
"**«Документ из переменной процесса»** отдельный фильтр типа не задаётся; "
"серверная валидация отклоняет такое сочетание."
msgstr "Available only with **Any document**, restricting events to the specified document type. A separate type filter cannot be set with **Current document** or **Document from process variable**; server validation rejects this combination."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:63
msgid "Имя переменной"
msgstr "Variable Name"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:65
msgid ""
"Поле становится доступно, если в ``Фильтр события по документу`` выбрано "
"значение ``Документ из переменной процесса``."
msgstr ""
"The field becomes available if the value ``Document from process "
"variable`` is selected in ``Event Filter by Document``."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:67
msgid ""
"В данном поле указывается имя переменной процесса, по которой будет "
"определяться документ, для которого будет возникать событие. Переменная "
"должна содержать EntityRef документа в виде String."
msgstr ""
"This field specifies the name of the process variable that will determine"
" the document for which the event will occur. The variable must contain "
"the document's EntityRef as a String."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:70
msgid "Фильтр события по предикатам"
msgstr "Event Filter by Predicates"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:72
msgid "Используется для фильтрации catch событий."
msgstr "Used for filtering catch events."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:74
msgid ""
"Моделью для вычисления предиката является payload события. В предикатах "
"можно ссылаться на атрибуты из payload события через "
"``{{someAttribute}}``. Если атрибут используется только в предикате, то "
"его можно использовать напрямую без объявления в модели."
msgstr ""
"The model for predicate evaluation is the event payload. In predicates, "
"you can reference attributes from the event payload using "
"``{{someAttribute}}``. If an attribute is used only in the predicate, it "
"can be used directly without declaration in the model."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:76
msgid ":ref:`Подробнее о предикатах <ecos-predicate_main>`"
msgstr ":ref:`More about predicates <ecos-predicate_main>`"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:80
msgid "При настройке сигнала учитывайте условную обязательность полей:"
msgstr "When configuring a signal, consider conditional field requirements:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:82
msgid "**«Тип события»**, если поле «Ручная настройка» = false;"
msgstr "**'Event Type'**, if the 'Manual Configuration' field = false;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:83
msgid "**«Имя сигнала»**, если поле «Ручная настройка» = true;"
msgstr "**'Signal Name'**, if the 'Manual Configuration' field = true;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:84
msgid "**«Фильтр события по документу»**;"
msgstr "**'Event Filter by Document'**;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:85
msgid ""
"**«Имя переменной»**, если поле «Фильтр события по документу» = «Документ"
" из переменной процесса»;"
msgstr ""
"**'Variable Name'**, if the 'Event Filter by Document' field = 'Document "
"from process variable';"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:86
msgid ""
"**«Фильтр события по типу документа»** или **«Фильтр события по "
"предикатам»**, если «Тип события» = «Record создан»"
msgstr ""
"**'Event Filter by Document Type'** or **'Event Filter by Predicates'**, "
"if 'Event Type' = 'Record created'"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:88
msgid ""
"Для типа **«Пользовательское действие»** необходимо выбрать действие. "
"Фильтр по типу документа допускается только с вариантом **«Любой "
"документ»**."
msgstr "For **User action** type, an action must be selected. Filtering by document type is allowed only with **Any document**."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:93
msgid "Payload событий"
msgstr "Event Payloads"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:95
msgid "Пример payload события **Статус изменен**"
msgstr "Example payload for the **Status Changed** event"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:112
msgid "Payload по умолчанию для всех событий"
msgstr "Default Payload for All Events"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:114
msgid "Каждое событие имеет payload по умолчанию, который содержит:"
msgstr "Every event has a default payload that contains:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:121
msgid "``_meta``"
msgstr "``_meta``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "Мета информация о событии. Содержит:"
msgstr "Meta information about the event. Contains:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "``id`` — уникальный идентификатор события (UUID)"
msgstr "``id`` — unique event identifier (UUID)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "``type`` — тип события (String)"
msgstr "``type`` — event type (String)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "``time`` — время возникновения события (Instant)"
msgstr "``time`` — time the event occurred (Instant)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "``user`` — username пользователя, который вызвал событие (String)"
msgstr "``user`` — username of the user who triggered the event (String)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:127
msgid "``record``"
msgstr "``record``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:128
msgid "Документ, по которому произошло событие (EntityRef)"
msgstr "The document for which the event occurred (EntityRef)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:129
msgid "``recordType``"
msgstr "``recordType``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:130
msgid "Тип документа, по которому произошло событие (EntityRef)"
msgstr "The type of document for which the event occurred (EntityRef)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:134
msgid ""
"По соглашению, каждое событие должно содержать атрибут ``record`` в виде "
"EntityRef. Если событие не содержит этого поля, то фильтрация по "
"документу не будет работать."
msgstr ""
"By convention, every event should contain a ``record`` attribute as an "
"EntityRef. If the event does not contain this field, filtering by "
"document will not work."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:137
msgid "Payload по умолчанию для предопределенных событий"
msgstr "Default Payload for Predefined Events"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:140
msgid "Record создан"
msgstr "Record Created"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:142
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:147
msgid "Дополнительная модель отсутствует."
msgstr "No additional model."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:145
msgid "Record удален"
msgstr "Record Deleted"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:150
msgid "Record изменен"
msgstr "Record Changed"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:157
msgid "``before``"
msgstr "``before``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:158
msgid "Атрибуты до изменения (Map<String, Any>)"
msgstr "Attributes before the change (Map<String, Any>)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:159
msgid "``after``"
msgstr "``after``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:160
msgid "Атрибуты после изменения (Map<String, Any>)"
msgstr "Attributes after the change (Map<String, Any>)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:164
msgid ""
"``diff`` исходного события не включается в переменную BPMN ``event`` "
"автоматически. Если требуется использовать его атрибуты, укажите их в "
"модели данных сигнала или предикате. Наличие атрибутов зависит от "
"исходного события. Модель сигнала по умолчанию содержит только ``before``"
" и ``after`` в дополнение к общим полям события."
msgstr ""
"The source event's ``diff`` is not automatically included in the BPMN "
"``event`` variable. To use its attributes, specify them in the signal "
"data model or predicate. Attribute availability depends on the source "
"event. In addition to common event fields, the default signal model "
"contains only ``before`` and ``after``."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:167
msgid "Статус изменен"
msgstr "Status Changed"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:184
msgid "**Тип изменения**:"
msgstr "**Change Type**:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:186
msgid "**Предыдущий** — статус до изменения;"
msgstr "**Previous** — status before the change;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:187
msgid "**Новый** — статус после изменения."
msgstr "**New** — status after the change."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:189
msgid ""
"**Статус** выбирается из выпадающего списка. Список статусов формируется "
"из привязанного типа данных."
msgstr ""
"**Status** is selected from a dropdown list. The list of statuses is "
"formed from the associated data type."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:191
msgid ""
"Тип изменения и статус задаются вместе. При их заполнении Citeck "
"формирует предикат статуса; произвольный предикат из отдельного поля на "
"этом пути не объединяется с ним автоматически."
msgstr "Change type and status are specified together. When filled in, Citeck generates a status predicate; an arbitrary predicate from the separate field is not automatically combined with it on this path."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:195
msgid "Комментарий создан"
msgstr "Comment Created"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:202
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:232
msgid "``text``"
msgstr "``text``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:203
msgid "Текст комментария (String)"
msgstr "Comment text (String)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:204
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:221
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:234
msgid "``commentRecord``"
msgstr "``commentRecord``"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:205
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:222
msgid "Рекорд созданного комментария (EntityRef)"
msgstr "Record of the created comment (EntityRef)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:207
msgid ""
"Для исходного события ``comment-create`` модель по умолчанию также "
"содержит ``attachments`` — ссылки на вложения, загружаемые через "
"``attachments[]?id``. Для совместимого события ``ecos.comment.create`` "
"это поле автоматически не добавляется."
